# creative — the "creator edition in one image" pack (#25, PROPOSAL §14). A
# curated multimedia/content-creation suite: NLE + audio + 3D + RAW photo +
# paint + transcode, plus the codec packages those tools lean on. Installed
# ONLINE on demand (official repos via pacman, AUR via paru) — nothing baked or
# stashed (design pivot #42); only this name-list rides in the image as TEXT.
#
# DaVinci Resolve is gated behind `iictl pack install creative --with-davinci`
# (AUR — heavy, EULA, NVIDIA/AMD GPU compute): post-add only installs it when
# the flag is passed. Declared here as a comment so the manifest documents it
# without the engine installing it unconditionally (it is NOT a plain member).
#meta:type creative
kdenlive
audacity
blender
darktable
krita
handbrake
# Codecs / media plumbing the suite leans on.
gst-plugins-good
gst-plugins-bad
gst-plugins-ugly
gst-libav
ffmpeg
# DaVinci Resolve — AUR, behind --with-davinci (NOT a plain member; installed by
# the post-add hook only when the flag is passed):
#   davinci-resolve
